DECL	{"args":[{"name":"x","sort":{"sort":"track"}},{"name":"i","sort":{"sort":"region"}}],"body":{"and":[{"rises":{"not":{"args":[{"var":"x"},{"var":"i"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}}},{"and":[{"cmp":"ge","lhs":{"heading_since":"x","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"x"},{"var":"i"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}},"rhs":{"param":"min_angle"}},{"cmp":"lt","lhs":{"heading_since":"x","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"x"},{"var":"i"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}},"rhs":{"param":"max_angle"}}]}]},"contract":"A road user has turned to the left through a region, such as an intersection the caller passes: at the observation it leaves the region (its footprint overlaps the region, rel.occupies, at the observation before and not at this one), and its heading change since its entry, integrated from its yaw rate (kin.yaw_rate, left positive) with sampling step bound `step`, is at least `min_angle` and below `max_angle`, the band in which the crossing counts as a left turn rather than a through movement or a reversal. The act begins at the entry, the observation at which the overlap last became true. The act is recognized at the observation it leaves the region. The concept holds only at the exit observation, ending at the next observation. Conduct before the entry is not read. Not denoted: a through movement or a heading change to the left below `min_angle`; a turn to the right; a reversal, a change at or beyond `max_angle`; a road user still within the region; which carrier it entered from, which the caller states; a crossing whose entry the recording does not show, for which the heading change since entry is unknown.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.left_turn_through_region","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"step","unit":"second"},{"name":"min_angle","unit":"degree"},{"name":"max_angle","unit":"degree"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
